{"ocrText": "54\nGRATITUDE\nWe are very grateful to the chauvinist newspaper, Volya\nNaroda,31 for publishing (in its issue of June 4) our documents\nrelating to our passage through Germany. It is evident\nfrom these documents that even at that time we found\nGrimm\u2019s behaviour \u201cambiguous\u201d and declined his services.\nThat  is  a  fact,  and  facts  cannot  be  talked  away.\nOur answer to the vague insinuations of Volya Naroda\nis: don\u2019t be cowards, gentlemen, accuse us openly of such-\nand-such a crime or misdemeanour! Have a go! Is it really\nhard to understand that it is dishonest to make vague insinu-\nations because of a fear to come out with an accusation over\none\u2019s  signature?\nPravda  No.  74,\nPublished  according  to\nJune  19  (6),  1917\nthe  Pravda  text", "textLayer": [{"text": "54", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 2.39, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "GRATITUDE", "x": 42.58, "y": 28.26, "w": 17.13, "h": 1.88, "fontSize": 11.2}, {"text": "We are very grateful to the chauvinist newspaper,", "x": 13.9, "y": 32.76, "w": 69.42, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Volya", "x": 83.79, "y": 32.78, "w": 7.31, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Naroda", "x": 11.11, "y": 34.72, "w": 9.4, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ",", "x": 20.5, "y": 34.7, "w": 0.73, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "31", "x": 21.27, "y": 34.6, "w": 1.63, "h": 1.16, "fontSize": 6.9}, {"text": "for publishing (in its issue of June 4) our documents", "x": 22.93, "y": 34.7, "w": 68.18, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "relating to our passage through Germany. It is evident", "x": 11.11, "y": 36.62, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "from these documents that", "x": 11.11, "y": 38.56, "w": 39.2, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "even at that time", "x": 51.29, "y": 38.58, "w": 26.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "we found", "x": 78.31, "y": 38.56, "w": 12.81, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Grimm\u2019s behaviour \u201cambiguous\u201d and declined his services.", "x": 11.11, "y": 40.5, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "That  is  a  fact,  and  facts  cannot  be  talked  away.", "x": 13.9, "y": 42.44, "w": 64.5, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Our answer to the vague insinuations of", "x": 13.9, "y": 44.38, "w": 57.54, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Volya Naroda", "x": 72.09, "y": 44.39, "w": 19.04, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "is: don\u2019t be cowards, gentlemen, accuse us", "x": 11.11, "y": 46.32, "w": 59.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "openly", "x": 70.82, "y": 46.33, "w": 9.33, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "of such-", "x": 80.65, "y": 46.32, "w": 10.46, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "and-such a crime or misdemeanour! Have a go! Is it really", "x": 11.11, "y": 48.23, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "hard to understand that it is", "x": 11.11, "y": 50.17, "w": 38.12, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "dishonest", "x": 49.66, "y": 50.19, "w": 12.72, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "to make vague insinu-", "x": 62.79, "y": 50.17, "w": 28.34, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "ations because of a fear to come out with an accusation over", "x": 11.11, "y": 52.11, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "one\u2019s  signature?", "x": 11.11, "y": 54.05, "w": 20.96, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 11.94, "y": 57.94, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "No.", "x": 20.0, "y": 57.93, "w": 3.23, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "74", "x": 24.15, "y": 57.98, "w": 2.01, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 26.4, "y": 57.93, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published", "x": 68.24, "y": 57.93, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "according", "x": 78.58, "y": 57.93, "w": 9.36, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "to", "x": 88.83, "y": 57.93, "w": 1.82, "h": 1.35, "fontSiz